#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_player
#! frames  400
#! poster  120
# Play clicked: the slider runs through the times at 8 snapshots per second and the pulse moves along the duct, turns
# back at t = 1.95 s (mode bounce); pause, then step forward and step back one snapshot; a right click on the slider
# opens the player's menu: the snapshots per second and the modes once, loop, bounce.
0   move 400 300
10  move 57 50 15
30  down
31  up
220 down
221 up
240 move 86 50 10
255 down
256 up
275 move 28 50 10
290 down
291 up
310 move 300 50 15
330 down right
331 up right
